<title>BELGIUM: Bank Paribas Belgium final 1996 profit revised up.</title>
<headline>Bank Paribas Belgium final 1996 profit revised up.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in billions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit	4.003 (3.968*)  vs	3.055</p>
<p>    Minorities		0.051 (0.050*)  vs	0.034</p>
<p>    Total assets	  757.4   (755.5*)  vs  720.0</p>
<p>NOTE - * provisional figure released in February. Bank Paribas Belgium is 77 percent owned by France's Paribas group, directly as well as via Belgium's Compagnie Benelux Paribas. The balance is held by Belgian institutions.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
